{
  "_name": "Widget tree editing and layout",
  "_purpose": "A widget added in the wrong place can be moved, one that is not wanted can be removed, and both refuse the cases that would leave the tree in a state the designer cannot show. Also pins the thing that makes layout writable at all: a widget in a Widget Blueprint's tree and the slot that positions it are ordinary named objects, so widget_tree reports their object paths and set_property writes them. That was true before anything reported the paths, which made it the same as absent.",
  "_requires": "Any project. Builds its own Widget Blueprint and deletes it afterwards.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "tool": "asset_create",
      "params": { "path": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "class": "WidgetBlueprint" }
    },
    {
      "tool": "widget_add",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "class": "/Script/UMG.CanvasPanel", "name": "Root" }
    },
    {
      "tool": "widget_add",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "class": "/Script/UMG.VerticalBox", "name": "Column", "parent": "Root" }
    },
    {
      "tool": "widget_add",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "class": "/Script/UMG.TextBlock", "name": "Label", "parent": "Root" }
    },
    {
      "_note": "The paths are the point. Without them a caller cannot construct ':WidgetTree.' by guessing, and the layout is unreachable.",
      "tool": "widget_tree",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe" },
      "expect": { "total": 3 }
    },
    {
      "_note": "A property on the widget itself.",
      "tool": "set_property",
      "params": {
        "object_path": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe.WBP_Probe:WidgetTree.Label",
        "property": "Text",
        "value": "Probe"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "And one on the slot, which is where position and size live. A canvas slot's left edge is under LayoutData.",
      "tool": "set_property",
      "params": {
        "object_path": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe.WBP_Probe:WidgetTree.Root.CanvasPanelSlot_1",
        "property": "LayoutData.Offsets.Left",
        "value": 250
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "get_property",
      "params": {
        "object_path": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe.WBP_Probe:WidgetTree.Root.CanvasPanelSlot_1",
        "property": "LayoutData.Offsets.Left"
      },
      "expect": { "value": 250 }
    },
    {
      "_note": "Moving it changes the slot CLASS, because the layout belongs to the panel and not to the widget - so the offsets set above are gone, not carried over.",
      "tool": "widget_modify",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "op": "reparent", "widget": "Label", "parent": "Column" },
      "expect": { "parent": "Column", "slot_class": "/Script/UMG.VerticalBoxSlot" }
    },
    {
      "tool": "widget_tree",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe" },
      "expect": { "total": 3 }
    },
    {
      "_note": "A misspelt widget name is answered with the nearest real one, not with silence.",
      "tool": "widget_modify",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "op": "remove", "widget": "Labl" },
      "expect_failure": true
    },
    {
      "_note": "Nothing in the engine checks for this, and a tree that is a ring hangs the designer on the next open.",
      "tool": "widget_modify",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "op": "reparent", "widget": "Root", "parent": "Column" },
      "expect_failure": true
    },
    {
      "_note": "A graph node reading the widget blocks the remove. The engine's delete would take that node with it, leaving a Blueprint that compiles clean and has quietly lost the logic.",
      "tool": "bp_modify",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "op": "add_node", "kind": "variable_get", "name": "Label", "graph": "EventGraph" }
    },
    {
      "tool": "widget_modify",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "op": "remove", "widget": "Label" },
      "expect_failure": true
    },
    {
      "tool": "widget_modify",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "op": "remove", "widget": "Label", "force": true },
      "expect": { "removed": true }
    },
    {
      "tool": "widget_tree",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe" },
      "expect": { "total": 2 }
    },
    {
      "_note": "Zero warnings as well as zero errors: the forced remove took the Get node with it, so there is nothing left referencing a variable that is gone.",
      "tool": "bp_compile",
      "params": { "blueprint": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe" },
      "expect": { "errors": 0, "warnings": 0 }
    }
  ],
  "teardown": [
    {
      "tool": "asset_modify",
      "params": { "op": "delete", "asset": "/Game/UplinkWidgetProbe/WBP_Probe", "force": true }
    }
  ]
}
